  "description": "NaLaO₂ crystallizes in the tetragonal I4₁/amd space group. Na¹⁺ is bonded in a square co-planar geometry to four equivalent O²⁻ atoms. All Na-O bond lengths are 2.43 Å. La³⁺ is bonded to six equivalent O²⁻ atoms to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing LaO₆ octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles are 18°. There are four shorter (2.43 Å) and two longer (2.47 Å) La-O bond lengths. O²⁻ is bonded to two equivalent Na¹⁺ and three equivalent La³⁺ atoms to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing ONa₂La₃ square pyramids.",
